#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:5
#: 9b88f81e244b41db92876ad392c287ca
msgid "i-BUS Telemetry"
msgstr "i-BUS 数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:7
#: 973810843493416099f0a62c8ddd758c
msgid ""
"i-BUS telemetry allows you to display ArduPilot information such as flight "
"modes, battery level, and speed, as well as information from other supported"
" i-BUS telemetry values on `Flysky <https://www.flysky-cn.com/plane>`__ and "
"Turnigy transmitters (using stock, modified, or OpenTX firmware) when using "
"an i-BUS receiver with a SENS port (such as the `iA6B <https://www.flysky-"
"cn.com/ia6b-canshu>`__, `FTr8B <https://www.flysky-"
"cn.com/ftr8bspecifications>`__, etc)."
msgstr ""
"i-BUS 数传允许在使用带 SENS 端口的 i-BUS 接收机（如 `iA6B <https://www.flysky-"
"cn.com/ia6b-canshu>`__、`FTr8B <https://www.flysky-"
"cn.com/ftr8bspecifications>`__ 等）时，在 `Flysky <https://www.flysky-"
"cn.com/plane>`__ 和 Turnigy 遥控器（使用原厂、修改版或 OpenTX 固件）上显示 ArduPilot "
"信息，如飞行模式、电量和速度，以及其他支持的 i-BUS 数传值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:9
#: 5b6109890c2747cfb303adf0af66c409
msgid "It is particularly useful:"
msgstr "它特别适用于："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:11
#: 1ddbbef427bc43b0b9ecec4c26e4d26c
msgid ""
"for flying without a ground control station (no need for MAVLink telemetry "
"radio),"
msgstr "无地面站飞行（无需 MAVLink 数传电台），"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:12
#: 6dfb6d5a47eb42e3bfdc3b4960c204d4
msgid ""
"as a backup in case the ground station fails (e.g., loss of MAVLink radio "
"link),"
msgstr "地面站失效时的备份（如 MAVLink 数传链路丢失），"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:13
#: fa98f0b63fbe4544a5fbcc90e78cbe46
msgid "when a separate person operates the ground control station,"
msgstr "由专门的人员操作地面控制站时，"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:14
#: b846271cd5ab4f81becc2b38124323c5
msgid "for quick situational awareness by the pilot."
msgstr "飞手快速了解飞行状况。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:16
#: 47a4b78fd6f14eeeacab96f7ee795356
msgid ""
"Moreover, some RC transmitters such as the Flysky FS-i6X can be modified "
"with OpenTX firmware, enabling a lot more functionality based on incoming "
"telemetry than stock firmware allows."
msgstr "此外，部分 RC 遥控器（如 Flysky FS-i6X）可通过 OpenTX 固件进行改装，基于传入的数传数据实现比原厂固件更多的功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:22
#: 2310258e7a564888b35ccaa369ae2f66
msgid ""
"i-BUS Telemetry setup with Flysky FS-i6 transmitter running stock firmware."
msgstr "运行原厂固件的 Flysky FS-i6 遥控器 i-BUS 数传设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:26
#: 5cae93ea99b140c3bf748aa871ffbe60
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:28
#: 9052cb44d870485bb764da5af0085544
msgid ""
"Support for this peripheral is included on all boards with *more* than 2MB "
"flash memory. It is also available for other boards using the `Custom "
"Firwmare Build Server <https://custom.ardupilot.org/>`__ , by creating a "
"firmware build including this feature listed under the Telemetry category."
msgstr ""
"所有 flash 超过 2MB 的板卡均已内置对此外设的支持。其他板卡也可通过 `自定义固件构建服务器 "
"<https://custom.ardupilot.org/>`__ 创建包含此功能的固件（在数传类别下选择）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:30
#: e45dccb23d4d4b4bb453b087b38f1b85
msgid "In order to use i-BUS telemetry, the following steps are required:"
msgstr "使用 i-BUS 数传需要以下步骤："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:32
#: 17ffdb8a570d4861952fc1b18ebba24e
msgid ""
"Connect the TX pin of an autopilot telemetry port to the signal pin of your "
"i-BUS receiver's SENS interface. No voltage or ground pins should be needed "
"as the receiver will already be powered by the PPM RC connection or the "
"servo rail."
msgstr ""
"将飞控数传口的 TX 引脚连接到 i-BUS 接收机 SENS 接口的信号引脚。无需连接电压或地线，因为接收机已通过 PPM RC 连接或舵机轨供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:33
#: 64418b4f9086411197d078fec091c0a7
msgid "Configure the autopilot."
msgstr "配置飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:34
#: 6ceb006f0a684a51a0a72c3080b82d16
msgid "Enable telemetry display on your supporting transmitter."
msgstr "在支持的遥控器上启用数传显示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:38
#: 17f65cd17b3e41b3ad75fcf2178a5425
msgid "Configuring ArduPilot"
msgstr "配置 ArduPilot"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:40
#: 06ffd258adb44e35904d3c93df64481c
msgid "Set the following parameters for the telemetry port used:"
msgstr "为所用数传口设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:42
#: 0f35949456524da095de9b42ddcb329f
msgid "``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` = 49"
msgstr "``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` = 49"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:43
#: 3696c8f20dfc46b095d6606e708e2557
msgid ""
"``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` = 0 / cleared as the library will set its own options"
msgstr "``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` = 0 / 清除，库将自行设置选项"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:45
#: 0d690aaf0a224d85818e3198e54f9308
msgid "``SERIALX_BAUD`` doesn't matter as the library will set its own baud"
msgstr "``SERIALX_BAUD`` 不重要，库将自行设置波特率"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:47
#: d537722c9b724187893526c90ad5620e
msgid ""
"SERIAL port numbers do not necessarily directly correspond to UART or TELEM "
"port labels. See the hardware documentation for your :ref:`autopilot "
"<common-autopilots>`."
msgstr ""
"SERIAL 端口编号不一定直接对应 UART 或 TELEM 端口标签。请参阅您的 :ref:`飞控 <common-autopilots>` "
"硬件文档。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:49
#: b112bf22881843628a3e69dfecab1f0a
msgid "Any configuration change to a UART requires a re-boot to take effect."
msgstr "对 UART 的任何配置更改都需要重启才能生效。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:52
#: e1cbfe26f12d43fe8f868ef79db12c5a
msgid "Configuring your transmitter"
msgstr "配置您的遥控器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:54
#: 78011b3cf3c146f59a8c0cc106cf5d82
msgid ""
"The process differs based on your transmitter's model. Some common ones are "
"listed here:"
msgstr "步骤因遥控器型号而异，以下是一些常见型号："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:56
#: 75eea902b60d4cbebb35958fac753e97
msgid ""
"Flysky FS-i6/X with stock firmware: page 21 of the user manual: "
"https://www.flysky-cn.com/fsi6"
msgstr "Flysky FS-i6/X（原厂固件）：用户手册第 21 页：https://www.flysky-cn.com/fsi6"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:57
#: 2bdc7b87691d415cb696c26bb847bf86
msgid ""
"Flysky FS-i6 with 14 channel firmware: "
"https://github.com/qba667/FlySkyI6/wiki/Telemetry"
msgstr ""
"Flysky FS-i6（14 通道固件）：https://github.com/qba667/FlySkyI6/wiki/Telemetry"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:58
#: 1009fc22c2c740ecafc3821e2bfb977c
msgid ""
"Flysky FS-i6X with OpenTX: Page to the *TELEMETRY* section of your model "
"configuration, then scroll down and select *Sensors* > *Discover new*"
msgstr ""
"Flysky FS-i6X（OpenTX）：进入机型配置的 *TELEMETRY* 部分，向下滚动选择 *Sensors* > *Discover "
"new*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:61
#: 3d9d1c2a0ee943e6b66aff08e1935416
msgid "Sensors"
msgstr "传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:63
#: ce262016b2f2403c83894811e454a019
msgid ""
"ArduPilot supports most standard i-BUS sensors for which it has a logical "
"equivalent data source. Most receivers, however, will only request the first"
" 15 available sensors and ignore the rest. Therefore the sensor types have "
"been sorted in order of subjective value for use on transmitters with small "
"screens such as entry-level Flysky transmitters."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 支持大多数标准 i-BUS 传感器（有对应逻辑数据源的）。但大多数接收机只请求前 15 "
"个可用传感器而忽略其余的。因此，传感器类型已按主观价值排序，以便在小屏幕遥控器（如入门级 Flysky 遥控器）上使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:65
#: 06b31695754d4859961ef49182383359
msgid ""
"Some sensors provide multiple values while only using one slot. Some (such "
"as GPS location or XYZ data) are logical groups of information but require a"
" sensor slot for each data point."
msgstr "部分传感器提供多个值但只占用一个槽位。部分传感器（如 GPS 位置或 XYZ 数据）是信息的逻辑分组，但每个数据点都需要一个传感器槽位。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:67
#: f063100634c74cee9911b46b427ec3f9
msgid ""
"If any sensors require features that have been excluded from your board's "
"build, those sensors will be excluded from the list allowing lower priority "
"sensors into the top 15 slots."
msgstr "如果某些传感器需要已从板卡固件中排除的功能，这些传感器将从列表中移除，允许优先级较低的传感器进入前 15 个槽位。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:69
#: e0a9841dd95641cfb9a021bb9468b114
msgid ""
"If you have a receiver that doesn't follow the standard limit and opts to "
"allow more sensors in exchange for a fractionally slower update frequency, "
"you will receive extra telemetry."
msgstr "如果您的接收机不遵守标准限制，以稍低的更新频率为代价允许更多传感器，您将获得额外的数传信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:71
#: 83181153d63b498bb90e9e9f3d8398a6
msgid "The sensor priority order is:"
msgstr "传感器优先级顺序为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:73
#: 40e48f792fd24bcc9fce3e4d172c2254
msgid "Armed status (Armed/UnArmed on stock/modified firmware; 0/1 on OpenTX)"
msgstr "解锁状态（原厂/修改版固件显示 Armed/UnArmed；OpenTX 显示 0/1）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:74
#: 40541d9cfe2349deb95f444a5d48d856
msgid ""
"Flight mode (where an equivalent i-BUS mode exists, otherwise blank; just a "
"number on OpenTX)"
msgstr "飞行模式（存在等效 i-BUS 模式时显示，否则为空；OpenTX 上仅显示数字）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:75
#: a0f8ccf2f8e34f8795165e28b24636b9
msgid ""
"GPS Status (0: unhealthy, 1: no fix, 2: 2D fix, 3: 3D fix) plus number of "
"satellites (using 1 slot total)"
msgstr "GPS 状态（0：不健康，1：无定位，2：2D 定位，3：3D 定位）加卫星数量（共占 1 个槽位）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:76
#: b0a66516880d4590ac4c20d8e3a478e5
msgid "Remaining battery or fuel %"
msgstr "剩余电量或燃油百分比"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:77
#: 2bb1b27f413e43cdac9a8afa4051f067
msgid "Battery voltage"
msgstr "电池电压"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:78
#: 0bbcddb9b7154f568341b8c2c4d115e7
msgid "Altitude"
msgstr "高度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:79
#: fde39dc3ed904e7db3744342cbbd8d17
msgid "Distance from home"
msgstr "距 Home 点距离"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:80
#: 804c276f27ac49788218e99ce21e598b
msgid "Climb rate / vertical speed"
msgstr "爬升率/垂直速度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:81
#: a85df9afd75a40038449a93ab5edfeef
msgid "Ground speed"
msgstr "对地速度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:82
#: ecb2c7d3e704463ea3a2d549a24754bb
msgid "Roll, Pitch & Yaw angles (3 separate sensors using 3 slots)"
msgstr "横滚、俯仰和偏航角（3 个独立传感器，占 3 个槽位）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ibus-telemetry.rst:83
#: bb78d05e364d42988f8954294d8027d7
